# Password Generator (Advanced Level)

**Oasis Infobyte SIP – Python Programming – Task 3** project[span_2](start_span)[span_2](end_span)[span_3](start_span)[span_3](end_span).

A desktop application built with **tkinter** that generates random and secure passwords using the `secrets` module[span_4](start_span)[span_4](end_span)[span_5](start_span)[span_5](end_span).

## Features

- Graphical User Interface: slider and spinbox for length control (8 to 64), checkboxes for character types[span_6](start_span)[span_6](end_span)[span_7](start_span)[span_7](end_span)
- Uses the `secrets` module (instead of `random`) for cryptographically secure generation[span_8](start_span)[span_8](end_span)
- Security: guarantees at least one character from each selected type, then securely shuffles the password[span_9](start_span)[span_9](end_span)
- Strength Indicator (Weak / Medium / Strong) with a colored bar, based on estimated entropy[span_10](start_span)[span_10](end_span)
- Automatic copy to clipboard on generation (`pyperclip`) + **Copy** button[span_11](start_span)[span_11](end_span)
- Option to exclude ambiguous characters: `0 O o 1 l I |`[span_12](start_span)[span_12](end_span)
- History of the last 5 generated passwords, **kept in memory only** (never written to disk)[span_13](start_span)[span_13](end_span)
- Validation: minimum length of 8, at least 2 character types required, mandatory numeric input[span_14](start_span)[span_14](end_span)[span_15](start_span)[span_15](end_span)

## Installation

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
Tkinter is included with Python (Linux: sudo apt install python3-tk). If pyperclip is not available, the application falls back to the Tkinter clipboard.
Run
python password_generator.py
Privacy
No passwords are saved to a file or sent over the network. The history disappears when the application is closed.
